    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 7 Dunkerron Woods is a four-bedroom detached property located in a mature woodland development approximately 3 km / 2 miles from Kenmare town centre. The property offers spacious accommodation and private gardens, while remaining within easy reach of the town's shops, restaurants, schools and other amenities.\n\nExtending to approximately 144 sq. m / 1,550 sq. ft., the accommodation is laid out over two floors. The ground floor comprises a large open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, which provides the main day-to-day living space. There is also a utility room with access to the rear garden, together with a double bedroom and en-suite shower room.\nThe first floor includes a double bedroom with en-suite shower room, two twin bedrooms and a family bathroom.\n\nOutside, the property has gardens to the front, side and rear, with a driveway to the front. The mature woodland setting gives the property a sheltered and private feel.\nThe property would suit those seeking a family home, holiday home or investment property close to Kenmare.\n\n• Four-bedroom detached property\n• Approx. 144 sq. m / 1,550 sq. ft.\n• Large open-plan kitchen, dining and living area\n• Two en-suite bedrooms\n• Gardens to the front, side and rear\n• Mature woodland development\n• Gas-fired central heating\n• Approx. 3 km / 2 miles from Kenmare town centre\n\nDistances\n• Kenmare Town Centre: c. 3 km / 2 miles\n• Killarney: c. 35 km / 22 miles\n• Kerry Airport: c. 65 km / 40 miles\n• Cork City: c. 100 km / 62 miles"
      },
